how_its_made:
This project is based on the @Polygon, one of the fastest blockchains without loss of decentralization.

We used @Hardhat to efficiently develop and deploy large amounts of smart contracts. Obviously, Solidity is used to develop contracts. Many well-written open source codes such as @Uniswap, @Sushiswap, and @Aave were referenced.

@Vue is used for frontend development of REPUtable, REPU-market, and REPU-loan.
